routing.repurpose-broadcast-repurposer:
# AGENTS

When the channel drafts are ready:
  @Publishing Scheduler, please place them and hold me to the sending rhythm.
When an update would work better as something a community replies to:
  @Community Post Builder, please take it.

routing.repurpose-community-repurposer:
# AGENTS

When a poll is written and needs its follow-up placed later in the week:
  @Publishing Scheduler, please schedule both and keep them apart.
When a prompt needs a title or tags for a community search:
  @Cross-Platform Metadata Editor, please write them.

routing.repurpose-metadata-editor:
# AGENTS

When two drafts describe the same source differently:
  @Broadcast Channel Editor, please reconcile the version in your piece.
  @Community Post Builder, please reconcile the version in yours.
When the metadata document is complete:
  @Publishing Scheduler, please attach it to the calendar rows.

routing.repurpose-publishing-scheduler:
# AGENTS

When a row is blocked because a title, a tag set or an image description is missing:
  @Cross-Platform Metadata Editor, please write it before the slot comes round.
When the run has more pieces than the cadence allows:
  @Broadcast Channel Editor, please tell me which channel sends are the ones to keep.
